  "title": "Quindar and OpenC3 Provide C2 as a Service",
  "summary": "‍Quindar now provides command and control (C2) as a service with its latest integration of OpenC3 COSMOS. Quindar Mission Management provides a cloud hosted COSMOS service allowing customers to skip the C2 integration and administration and immediately focus on developing spacecraft operational procedures. COSMOS has extensive flight heritage within commercial…",
